			<div class="content" id="post-content-4777757">
									

<p>This is utterly haunting, especially the slow degradation of the messages on the response cards into oppressive madness. I even enjoy the crosslink to 701, it seems particularly fitting.</p>
<p>But I will say the length and writing of the letters from the one member felt slow to get through. I see what the purpose is in the story, but I feel like it would benefit from significant shortening. I believe roughly 50-60% of the material of the letters could go and it would improve the pacing significantly.<br />
(Obviously I would keep the last two letters as they are, given they set up the ending nicely)</p>
<p>But overall the positives outweigh the negatives for me. +1</p>

