			<div class="content" id="post-content-4798535">
									

<p>I've gone back and forth on this article more often than a pendulum swings. Woody's letters are my sticking point &#8212; the first four are too long and preachy (even if that's the point) for my liking. They should be pared down dramatically to keep the fate of the commune in the reader's mind and give the computer's corruption by the Hanged King proportionally more significance, because that is far and away the most interesting concept here.</p>

