			<div class="content" id="post-content-4809188">
									

<p>The thing that gets to me is, this hardly even seems anomalous.</p>
<p>Sure, it's got no sensors, but most computers don't. And this one just writes coherent sentences when prompted. Are they true? Does it predict the future? The only thing outright spooky is that it apparently has access to Foundation databases, a well-worn trope, and that's literally the last thing in the article. I had to come here to get a real indication of what's going on, and that may just be too deep a cut to effectively and impactfully encapsulate within the text.</p>

							</div>

								
					
